codex
The failure is reproducible and narrowly diagnosed: this sandbox reports namespace PID `2` to processes, but mounts host `/proc`, so Lean 4.22’s `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` lookup fails even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m using a local read-only compatibility shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not modify the generated project or trusted code. I’ll validate the shim with `lean --version`, then rerun the unchanged preflight function.
apply patch
